    "site_desc": "The study site is located at Vista Hermosa, 15 km east from Guatavita (township), in Cundinamarca (department), Colombia. Vista Hermosa is a natural protected reserve. The EC flux tower (2.5 m in height)  is located within a drained peatland with low herbaceous vegetation. The site is a flat basin with a 150 ha wetland on an old glacier lake bottom.",
